with an exact 2-line provenance header. Every slice parses standalone under `node --input-type=module --check -` and round-trips byte-exact to its recorded readable line range. Stylesheet rule — the two inline <style> blocks are wholeFile sections, never sliced. Non-code payloads (icon-192.png, icon-512.png, og.jpg and the manifest.webmanifest data file) are hashed notRendered records (bytes + sha256, no pretty pass). The off-origin loads (the Google Fonts stylesheet + font origins, the gstatic firebase base the optional cloud-login path dynamic-imports) were never captured (socker precedent, PLAN §1) and have no derived layer; tools/capture.mjs --check lists them as external references. Identifiers in src/ are the bundle's own names — the rename campaign (PLAN §5) is recorded as an open task in README.md, not claimed here. Capture bytes are untouched by everything above; re-cut with `node tools/derive.mjs` after any capture refresh. `node tools/audit.js` is the gate.",
